      <Docs>
        <summary>Creates a builder for a change log token request.</summary>
        <remarks>
          <para>Add record types or medical resource types before calling <see cref="M:Android.Health.Connect.ChangeLog.ChangeLogTokenRequest.Builder.Build" />. The two types of data cannot be selected in the same request.</para>
          <para>These details are based on the <format type="text/html"><a href="https://android.googlesource.com/platform/packages/modules/HealthFitness/+/a292a16a8ac82667b65d763c00fa935cc44e9925/framework/java/android/health/connect/changelog/ChangeLogTokenRequest.java">Android source for ChangeLogTokenRequest.Builder</a></format>.</para>
