      <Docs>
        <param name="dataOriginFilter">The data origin whose package name is added to the filter.</param>
        <summary>Adds a data origin filter to the change log token request.</summary>
        <returns>This builder.</returns>
        <remarks>
          <para>Each call adds one data origin's package name to the set of filters. If no data origin filter is added, the request does not restrict change logs by data origin.</para>
          <para>These details are based on the <format type="text/html"><a href="https://android.googlesource.com/platform/packages/modules/HealthFitness/+/a292a16a8ac82667b65d763c00fa935cc44e9925/framework/java/android/health/connect/changelog/ChangeLogTokenRequest.java">Android source for addDataOriginFilter</a></format>. The parameter is one data origin, not a list of package names.</para>
        </remarks>
      </Docs>
    </Member>
